  "remarks": "LLC NTTs VOSTOKspecialises in manufacture of weapons and ammunition. It supplies semi-finished electronics and other components to JSC IEMZ Kupol. It specifically supplies components used in the production of warheads of the Garpiya-A1 one-way attack UAVs. These UAVs are used by the Russian Armed Forces during Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
